			"Message": "build(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates across 3 components\n\nSynchronize Cocoon, Mountain, and Wind submodules with the following changes:\n- **Mountain:** Streamline extension path and NodeResolver module docs — simplify ScanPathConfigure comments for extension skip flags and builtin path override. Condense NodeResolver module docstring to compact ladder list showing resolution order: LAND_NODE_BINARY → shipped runtime → fnm/volta/asdf/nvm → homebrew → PATH. Behavior unchanged.\n- **Wind:** Split monolithic PostHogBridge.ts into modular components under Source/Telemetry/PostHog/ — Browser.ts (window.posthog lookup), Configuration.ts (import.meta.env config), Fallback.ts (fetch POST fallback), Identifier.ts (distinct_id resolution), Properties.ts (base event properties). PostHogBridge.ts now composes these modules for improved testability.\n- **Cocoon:** Submodule updated to 33544546.\n\nThis coordinated update delivers documentation improvements and modular telemetry architecture while maintaining identical runtime behavior.",
