			"Message": "build(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates across 12 components\n\nSynchronize all 12 Element submodules with the following changes:\n\n- **Mountain:** Add Node binary resolver for Cocoon sidecar spawning - checks explicit override, shipped runtime, version managers (fnm, volta, asdf, nvm), Homebrew, and PATH fallback. Add extension path environment variables (LAND_DISABLE_BUILTIN_EXTENSIONS, LAND_BUILTIN_EXTENSIONS_DIR, LAND_USER_EXTENSIONS_DIR, LAND_EXTRA_EXTENSIONS_DIRS, LAND_DEV_EXTENSIONS_DIR). Fix profile sentinel to use compile-time option_env! instead of runtime env::var. Add extensions:resetPinnedStateForAllUserExtensions handler.\n\n- **Sky:** Signal Mountain lifecycle phases from frontend via `lifecycle:advancePhase` IPC command to skip 8s/23s fallback timers. Uses dynamic import for @tauri-apps/api/core in plain module context. Implements Atom P3 milestone for optimized lifecycle management.\n\n- **Cocoon, Echo, Wind, Worker:** Dependency updates - pnpm/action-setup bumped to 6.0.3 across all TypeScript repos. Echo also updates @cloudflare/workers-types, wrangler, and miniflare.\n\n- **Mist, Output, Rest:** Normalize CHANGELOG formatting - replace em dashes (—) with hyphens (-) in version headers and list separators for consistent Keep a Changelog style.\n\n- **Common:** Merge branch sync with upstream.\n\nThis coordinated update delivers Node runtime resolution for extension host spawning, frontend-driven lifecycle optimization, and standardizes documentation formatting across the monorepo.",
